# Rule-Based AI Chatbot

## Project Overview
The Rule-Based AI Chatbot is an intelligent conversational system that responds to user queries using predefined rules and pattern matching techniques. The project demonstrates the fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence and Natural Language Processing through a simple yet effective chatbot application.

## Objectives
- Develop a chatbot capable of interacting with users.
- Implement rule-based logic for generating responses.
- Understand the basics of conversational AI.
- Improve problem-solving and Python programming skills.

## Features
- Interactive user conversations
- Rule-based response generation
- Pattern matching for user input
- Easy-to-modify response rules
- Beginner-friendly implementation

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Rule-Based Logic
- Natural Language Processing (Basic Concepts)

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:
   git clone https://github.com/Shruthi1914/Decodelabs-Internship.git

2. Navigate to the project directory:
   cd Decodelabs-Internship

3. Run the chatbot:
   python chatbot.py

## Usage
Run the application and enter your queries through the console. The chatbot will provide responses based on predefined rules and patterns.

